{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"skat-card-game UI copy.details","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"skat-card-game.copy.details","keys":["skat-card-game.copy.details"],"locale":"ha","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Wani rarraba yana amfani da katin ZXQPH0000QXZ: bakwai, takwas, tara, jakar, matar, sarki, goma da ace a kowace tufafi. Duk mai wasa yana samun katinni goma kuma biyu suna samar da Skat. Ka yi zagaye; wanda ya fi girman zagaye yana zaɓar da'ira, zuciya, spade, alade, Grand ko kuma Null. Da wasa mai karɓa, karɓi Skat kuma ka mayar da katinni biyu; da hannun, ka bar shi ba a gani ba. 'Yan wasa dole ne su bi tufafin da aka jagoranta ko kuma trumf idan zai yiwu. wasannin tufafi da Grand suna buƙatar idanun ZXQPH0001QXZ; a Null, mai lissafa bai kamata ya ɗauki wata dabara ba.","record_id":"b675ba32ef5e83886a7ca7b0c24e096542b907cfaf8b104d4091c2096d6eb5e6","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":4.17946436037505,"source":"A deal uses 32 cards: seven, eight, nine, Jack, Queen, King, ten and ace in each suit. Each player gets ten cards and two form the Skat. Bid in turn; the highest bidder chooses diamonds, hearts, spades, clubs, Grand or Null. With a pickup game, take the Skat and return two cards; with Hand, leave it unseen. Players must follow the led suit or trump when possible. Suit and Grand games need 61 eyes; in Null, the declarer must take no trick.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"7850c2586a2737a7960b5257390f795f390b02bd0fc491fcc9a26eb426d3fdea","status":"needs-review","translation":"Wani rarraba yana amfani da katin 32: bakwai, takwas, tara, jakar, matar, sarki, goma da ace a kowace tufafi. Duk mai wasa yana samun katinni goma kuma biyu suna samar da Skat. Ka yi zagaye; wanda ya fi girman zagaye yana zaɓar da'ira, zuciya, spade, alade, Grand ko kuma Null. Da wasa mai karɓa, karɓi Skat kuma ka mayar da katinni biyu; da hannun, ka bar shi ba a gani ba. 'Yan wasa dole ne su bi tufafin da aka jagoranta ko kuma trumf idan zai yiwu. wasannin tufafi da Grand suna buƙatar idanun 61; a Null, mai lissafa bai kamata ya ɗauki wata dabara ba.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
